<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch December consumer spending rises 1.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Dutch December consumer spending rises 1.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch consumer spending rose 1.2 percent in volume terms in December compared with December 1995, the Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said.  </p>
<p>Dutch full-year 1996 gross domestic product (GDP) rose a provisional 2.7 percent year-on-year, the Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said.</p>
